Foldcade art kit: license note

All images and vector art in this kit (res/drawable/*.xml, res/drawable-nodpi/*.9.png,
res/mipmap-*/*, svg/**, play/*, themes/afterglow/preview.png, themes/afterglow/sprites/*,
previews/*, contact-sheet.png) are original Foldcade art, licensed under
Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0),
matching themes/afterglow. Full text: themes/afterglow/LICENSE in the repo, or
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/legalcode

The generator scripts in src/ and the shader in shaders/focus_glow.agsl are program
source and stay under the GNU GPLv3 with the rest of Foldcade.

Letterforms on the controller glyphs and notification badges (A, B, X, Y, L, R, L1, R1,
L2, R2, digits) are outlines converted from Nunito ExtraBold (SIL Open Font License 1.1,
see themes/afterglow/OFL-Nunito.txt). They are drawn shapes, not an embedded font.

Nothing here is taken from or derived from Nintendo, Sony, Microsoft, Disney, iiSU, or
Cocoon marks, logos, or art. Face buttons are letters on neutral round caps with no
brand colours. Platform marks are generic device silhouettes, not console logos.
The Bluetooth status glyph follows the common system-status convention for the
Bluetooth indicator; it is redrawn here, not copied.
